#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:5
msgid "Replace conductor property"
msgstr "替换导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the feature of automatic searching of `conductor`_ "
"with an specific property for replacing `conductor properties`_ without the "
"need of searching the `conductor`_ manually around the project."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech提供了 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的自动搜索特性，具有替换 `导体属性 <conductor "
"properties_>`_ 的特定属性，而无需在项目周围人工搜索 `导体 <conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:13
msgid ""
"If the `search menu`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Edit > "
"Search / Replace** menu item."
msgstr "如果不显示 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_，可以从 **编辑 > 搜索/替换** 菜单项中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:16
msgid "To replace some `conductor properties`_:"
msgstr "替换一些 `导体特性 <conductor properties_>`_:"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Search`_ the property (Manufacturer, Label, etc.) which identifies the "
"`conductor`_ from which a property has to be changed."
msgstr "`搜索 <Search_>`_ 能够识别以下特征的财产(制造商、标签等)。 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 必须改变财产。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:23
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:25
msgid ""
"Press the **Conductor** button to display the conductor properties PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "按 **出纳器** 按钮显示导师属性 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:30
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor properties replace PopUp windows"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导体属性替换弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:32
msgid ""
"Fill the text line box from the `conductor properties`_ which should be "
"changed."
msgstr "从 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 中填充文本行框，该属性应当修改。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:36
msgid ""
"QElectroTech also allows deleting and making empty a filled property. Click "
"the checkbox button located right from the text which should be deleted."
msgstr "QElectroTech 还允许删除并空置一个已填充的属性。单击位于文本右侧的复选框按钮，该按钮应当删除 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:39
msgid "Press **Accept**."
msgstr "按 **接受**."

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:40
msgid ""
"From the `conductors`_ found at the search process, select the `conductors`_"
" where the replace action have to be applied. The selection can be made at "
"the object tree from the `search menu`_."
msgstr ""
"从搜索过程中发现的 `导体 <conductors_>`_，选择必须应用替换动作的 `导体 <conductors_>`_。选择可以在 `搜索菜单 "
"<search menu_>`_ 中的对象树上进行。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:41
msgid ""
"Press **Replace all** button to apply the replace action to all selected "
"`conductors`_."
msgstr "按 **替换所有** 按钮，将替换动作应用到所有选定的 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:45
msgid ""
"Replacing action can also be applied `conductor`_ by `conductor`_. The "
"button **Replace** will only apply the action to the displayed `conductor`_ "
"at the `workspace`_. The buttons |go-top| and |go-bottom| can be used to "
"display the previous and next `conductor`_ from the search result."
msgstr ""
"替换动作也可以由 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 应用 `导体 <conductor_>`_。按钮 **替换** 只将动作应用到在 `导体 "
"<conductor_>`_ 显示的 `工作区 <workspace_>`_，按钮 |go-top| 和 |go-bottom| "
"可以用来显示搜索结果中上一个和下一个 `导体 <conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:50
msgid "go-top"
msgstr "上进"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/conductor_prop_replace.rst:49
msgid "go-bottom"
msgstr "向下移动"
